.TH "spa-resample" 1 "1.6.8" "PipeWire" \" -*- nroff -*-
.ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
spa-resample \- The PipeWire resampler debugging utility

.PP
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.PP

.PP
\fBspa-resample\fP [\fIOPTIONS\fP] \fIINFILE\fP \fIOUTFILE\fP

.PP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP

.PP
Use the PipeWire resampler to resample input file to output file, following the given options\&.

.PP
This is useful only for testing the resampler\&.

.PP
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP

.PP
\fB-r RATE | --rate=RATE\fP
.RS 4
Output sample rate\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB-f FORMAT | --format=FORMAT\fP
.RS 4
Output sample format (s8 | s16 | s32 | f32 | f64)\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB-q QUALITY | --quality=QUALITY\fP
.RS 4
Resampler output quality (0-14)\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB-c FLAGS | --cpuflags=FLAGS\fP
.RS 4
See \fBspa/support/cpu\&.h\fP\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB-h\fP
.RS 4
Show help\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB-v\fP
.RS 4
Verbose operation\&.
.RE
.PP
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.PP

.PP
\fBspa-resample\fP -r 48000 -f s32 in\&.wav out\&.wav

.PP
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.PP

.PP
The PipeWire Developers <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/pipewire/pipewire/issues>; PipeWire is available from <https://pipewire.org>

.PP
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP

.PP
\fBpipewire(1)\fP 

